      "message": "`VtsAidlSharedSecretTargetTest` is now good.\n\n```\n[26/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#TimeoutAuthentication/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: FAILED (4.075s)\n\nSTACKTRACE:\nhardware/interfaces/security/keymint/aidl/vts/functional/AuthTest.cpp:359: Failure\nValue of: timestamp_token_required_\n  Actual: false\nExpected: true\n[27/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#TimeoutAuthenticationIncorrectTimestampToken/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: IGNORED (50ms)\n[28/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#TimeoutAuthenticationMultiSid/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: PASSED (118ms)\n[29/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#AuthPerOperation/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: PASSED (59ms)\n[30/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#AuthPerOperationMultiSid/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: PASSED (116ms)\n[31/286] PerInstance/AuthTest#AuthPerOperationWrongAuthType/0_android_hardware_security_keymint_IKeyMintDevice_default: PASSED (59ms)\n```",
