      "writtenOn": "2024-04-11T05:56:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `AuthTest#TimeoutAuthentication` is failing, I\u0027d imagine that\u0027s because Gatekeeper and KeyMint aren\u0027t using the same clock epoch.\n\nThe non-secure [KeyMint clock](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/security/keymint/aidl/default/ta/clock.rs) looks to have an unhelpful epoch. (I went back and forth in aosp/2856649 as to which clock to use; looks like I ended up with the wrong choice)\n\nHopefully shifting that to match the [Gatekeeper clock](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:device/google/cuttlefish/host/commands/secure_env/soft_gatekeeper.h;l\u003d97;drc\u003d3d19fbcc09b1b44928639b06cd0b88f735cd988d;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1) will fix things.\n\nThe [history](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/hardware/interfaces/+/2856649/6..8/security/keymint/aidl/default/ta/clock.rs) from aosp/2856649 should give the code we need, BTW.",
      "parentUuid": "5c44470c_61142ffb",
